const level7 = `
SYSTEM  Role · Task · Context (category definitions) · Output format (JSON schema from Pydantic)
        → explicit steps (CoT) for the judgment part

CHAIN   1. extract fields     → Gate: Pydantic shape + strict types
        2. assess urgency     → Gate: rules cross-check (e.g. "outage" ⇒ not Low)
        3. route              → plain code, no LLM
        any gate fails        → retry with the error (feedback loop, capped) → human review

TOOLS   look up the customer's account / order when the email references one (ReAct)

LOG     prompt · response · gate results · model version, per step, per email
`.trim();

